1
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:08,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Everyone's responsible
for copyright protection.]</font>

2
00:00:09,290 --> 00:00:14,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪After all the joy and sorrow♪</font>

3
00:00:14,520 --> 00:00:18,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still recall your face♪</font>

4
00:00:19,710 --> 00:00:25,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You were by my side;
the cool rain fell♪</font>

5
00:00:25,360 --> 00:00:30,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I closed my eyes
and heard you sing gently♪</font>

6
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:36,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'd wager all
for a love that never ends♪</font>

7
00:00:37,130 --> 00:00:40,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To keep you forever near♪</font>

8
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:47,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this vast world,
I wait for your light♪</font>

9
00:00:47,720 --> 00:00:52,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll share this dream
till dawn is bright♪</font>

10
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:58,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪All the riddles of parting
I'll uncover♪</font>

11
00:00:58,820 --> 00:01:01,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At last, I'll sing, kiss, and hold you♪</font>

12
00:01:01,080 --> 00:01:04,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The answer is revealed
within your heart♪</font>

13
00:01:09,700 --> 00:01:12,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Legendary Chitose-Sama]</font>

14
00:01:12,020 --> 00:01:16,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 6]</font>

15
00:01:30,220 --> 00:01:30,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

16
00:01:31,340 --> 00:01:32,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The mansion is unsettled right now.</font>

17
00:01:32,980 --> 00:01:33,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have someone keep a close watch on her.</font>

18
00:01:34,540 --> 00:01:35,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, Your Highness.</font>

19
00:01:53,900 --> 00:01:57,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Prince Duan's Mansion]</font>

20
00:02:09,460 --> 00:02:10,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I won't eat.</font>

21
00:02:10,660 --> 00:02:11,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get out.</font>

22
00:02:38,180 --> 00:02:38,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who's there?</font>

23
00:02:54,460 --> 00:02:55,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Could it be that person from back then?</font>

24
00:03:11,060 --> 00:03:12,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Method to leave]</font>

25
00:03:49,460 --> 00:03:50,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are you here?</font>

26
00:03:52,020 --> 00:03:52,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've killed someone?</font>

27
00:03:54,220 --> 00:03:55,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Would I need to go to such trouble
to kill someone?</font>

28
00:03:56,980 --> 00:03:58,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You were drinking human blood.</font>

29
00:03:58,940 --> 00:04:00,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I could never mistake that scent.</font>

30
00:04:01,060 --> 00:04:01,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So what?</font>

31
00:04:06,940 --> 00:04:07,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now you've drunk it too.</font>

32
00:04:14,580 --> 00:04:15,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness!</font>

33
00:04:15,860 --> 00:04:16,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness!</font>

34
00:04:16,700 --> 00:04:17,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness!</font>

35
00:04:17,620 --> 00:04:18,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go after her!</font>

36
00:04:19,780 --> 00:04:20,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

37
00:04:23,500 --> 00:04:24,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

38
00:04:26,140 --> 00:04:26,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

39
00:04:26,700 --> 00:04:27,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness, what's wrong?</font>

40
00:04:27,860 --> 00:04:28,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

41
00:04:31,260 --> 00:04:31,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness!</font>

42
00:04:32,060 --> 00:04:32,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness!</font>

43
00:04:33,500 --> 00:04:33,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness!</font>

44
00:04:34,540 --> 00:04:35,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guards!</font>

45
00:04:35,780 --> 00:04:40,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Prince Duan's Mansion]</font>

46
00:04:42,700 --> 00:04:43,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After this heroic deed,</font>

47
00:04:44,340 --> 00:04:45,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we will surely go down</font>

48
00:04:45,820 --> 00:04:47,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in history.</font>

49
00:04:48,620 --> 00:04:50,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What if Father finds out?
I'm still scared.</font>

50
00:04:51,060 --> 00:04:51,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't be afraid.</font>

51
00:04:52,500 --> 00:04:54,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then you take all the blame.</font>

52
00:04:54,700 --> 00:04:55,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It has nothing to do with me.</font>

53
00:04:55,580 --> 00:04:56,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright, stop talking.</font>

54
00:04:56,100 --> 00:04:56,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll take the blame.</font>

55
00:04:57,340 --> 00:04:58,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go over the plan.</font>

56
00:04:58,260 --> 00:04:58,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In a moment, I'll...</font>

57
00:04:59,020 --> 00:04:59,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll throw the bucket.</font>

58
00:05:00,380 --> 00:05:01,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm nervous.</font>

59
00:05:01,580 --> 00:05:02,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll throw the oil,</font>

60
00:05:02,580 --> 00:05:03,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and you throw the torch.</font>

61
00:05:03,740 --> 00:05:04,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop dawdling.</font>

62
00:05:04,500 --> 00:05:05,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry up.</font>

63
00:05:05,860 --> 00:05:06,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you ready?</font>

64
00:05:09,180 --> 00:05:11,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Prince Duan's Mansion]
Fire! Put out the fire!</font>

65
00:05:12,220 --> 00:05:12,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Quick!</font>

66
00:05:12,580 --> 00:05:14,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's on fire!</font>

67
00:05:14,100 --> 00:05:15,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go put it out!</font>

68
00:05:15,100 --> 00:05:17,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry, put out the fire!</font>

69
00:05:17,100 --> 00:05:18,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Quick, this way.</font>

70
00:05:18,500 --> 00:05:20,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan! Qinglan!</font>

71
00:05:20,220 --> 00:05:20,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've come to save you.</font>

72
00:05:21,100 --> 00:05:21,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What have you done?</font>

73
00:05:22,300 --> 00:05:23,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't mind that. Just go!</font>

74
00:05:24,620 --> 00:05:25,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Someone, help with the fire!</font>

75
00:05:29,380 --> 00:05:30,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Eunuch Fuhai.</font>

76
00:05:30,820 --> 00:05:31,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Honored guests,</font>

77
00:05:31,540 --> 00:05:32,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">please follow me.</font>

78
00:05:32,380 --> 00:05:33,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They will draw away the pursuers.</font>

79
00:05:34,420 --> 00:05:34,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go.</font>

80
00:05:36,900 --> 00:05:37,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Stop!
- Stop!</font>

81
00:05:38,340 --> 00:05:39,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Over there!
- Over there, stop!</font>

82
00:05:40,740 --> 00:05:42,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Hurry!
- Stop!</font>

83
00:05:43,460 --> 00:05:44,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Eunuch Fuhai, what brings you here?</font>

84
00:05:44,980 --> 00:05:45,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Jiang,</font>

85
00:05:45,940 --> 00:05:48,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we should finish what we started.</font>

86
00:05:48,460 --> 00:05:50,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Princess worried
Mr. and Ms. Jiang might struggle,</font>

87
00:05:51,100 --> 00:05:51,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so she ordered me</font>

88
00:05:52,220 --> 00:05:53,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to lend you a hand once more.</font>

89
00:05:54,180 --> 00:05:55,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you, Eunuch Fuhai.</font>

90
00:05:57,860 --> 00:05:58,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">By the way, Chief,</font>

91
00:05:59,220 --> 00:06:00,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how is my mother?</font>

92
00:06:00,220 --> 00:06:01,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was about to ask you that.</font>

93
00:06:01,340 --> 00:06:02,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The day Mrs. Jun left
Prince Duan's Mansion,</font>

94
00:06:02,620 --> 00:06:03,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she was in tears.</font>

95
00:06:03,740 --> 00:06:04,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She didn't say a word.</font>

96
00:06:04,940 --> 00:06:06,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I went to Yizhuang the next day,</font>

97
00:06:06,220 --> 00:06:07,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">her things were already gone.</font>

98
00:06:07,620 --> 00:06:08,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where do you think she went?</font>

99
00:06:08,780 --> 00:06:09,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun,</font>

100
00:06:09,540 --> 00:06:10,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your mother didn't tell you</font>

101
00:06:10,460 --> 00:06:11,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she'd moved out?</font>

102
00:06:12,300 --> 00:06:13,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Could something have happened?</font>

103
00:06:14,460 --> 00:06:15,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao.</font>

104
00:06:16,380 --> 00:06:17,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You forced my hand.</font>

105
00:06:18,660 --> 00:06:19,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Princess Changle's Mansion]</font>

106
00:06:19,740 --> 00:06:21,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The younger generation is formidable.</font>

107
00:06:21,860 --> 00:06:24,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I never thought you'd go
against Prince Duan</font>

108
00:06:24,460 --> 00:06:25,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for a mere coroner.</font>

109
00:06:29,220 --> 00:06:29,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This time,</font>

110
00:06:30,260 --> 00:06:31,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">thanks to you,</font>

111
00:06:31,340 --> 00:06:32,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my sister and I could learn</font>

112
00:06:32,300 --> 00:06:33,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of Qinglan's situation at the mansion.</font>

113
00:06:34,740 --> 00:06:36,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You even arranged for Eunuch Fuhai</font>

114
00:06:36,140 --> 00:06:36,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to meet us in secret.</font>

115
00:06:37,220 --> 00:06:38,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was most thoughtful.</font>

116
00:06:38,620 --> 00:06:40,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But this matter
has nothing to do with you.</font>

117
00:06:40,700 --> 00:06:42,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We fear it might implicate you.</font>

118
00:06:43,260 --> 00:06:44,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I simply felt</font>

119
00:06:44,380 --> 00:06:46,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that this coroner has real talent.</font>

120
00:06:47,180 --> 00:06:49,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It would be a shame
to let Prince Duan ruin her.</font>

121
00:06:49,860 --> 00:06:51,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I merely passed along a message.</font>

122
00:06:52,340 --> 00:06:54,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His anger won't fall on me.</font>

123
00:06:55,220 --> 00:06:56,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm honored by your favor.</font>

124
00:06:59,100 --> 00:07:01,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan is
terribly protective of you.</font>

125
00:07:02,420 --> 00:07:03,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wouldn't want to be seen</font>

126
00:07:03,980 --> 00:07:05,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">as the one who stirred up trouble
at the final moment.</font>

127
00:07:06,180 --> 00:07:07,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He can't be a good man.</font>

128
00:07:07,700 --> 00:07:08,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan was in a state of panic,</font>

129
00:07:08,580 --> 00:07:09,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">fleeing from Prince Duan's Mansion.</font>

130
00:07:11,460 --> 00:07:12,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">During those two days
of the mansion's lockdown,</font>

131
00:07:13,340 --> 00:07:14,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what exactly happened to you inside?</font>

132
00:07:15,580 --> 00:07:16,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun,</font>

133
00:07:16,340 --> 00:07:17,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just tell us the truth.</font>

134
00:07:18,100 --> 00:07:18,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did Prince Duan</font>

135
00:07:18,980 --> 00:07:19,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">do anything utterly heartless</font>

136
00:07:19,900 --> 00:07:20,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to you?</font>

137
00:07:22,140 --> 00:07:22,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I saw something</font>

138
00:07:23,940 --> 00:07:24,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wasn't meant to see.</font>

139
00:07:27,220 --> 00:07:28,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Could it be that Prince Duan's Mansion</font>

140
00:07:28,260 --> 00:07:30,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">harbors a dark secret?</font>

141
00:07:31,500 --> 00:07:32,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Jun, speak freely.</font>

142
00:07:33,540 --> 00:07:34,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will back you up.</font>

143
00:07:36,700 --> 00:07:37,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I saw</font>

144
00:07:38,700 --> 00:07:40,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan drinking blood in his room.</font>

145
00:07:41,380 --> 00:07:42,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Blood? Whose blood?</font>

146
00:07:42,900 --> 00:07:43,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Pig's blood, duck's blood,
or cow's blood?</font>

147
00:07:44,180 --> 00:07:45,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It wasn't human blood, right?</font>

148
00:07:45,140 --> 00:07:45,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun, are you alright?</font>

149
00:07:45,740 --> 00:07:46,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Ying, don't be so dramatic.</font>

150
00:07:46,980 --> 00:07:48,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan, take your time.</font>

151
00:07:48,900 --> 00:07:50,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I also saw a corpse</font>

152
00:07:50,100 --> 00:07:51,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">drained completely of blood.</font>

153
00:07:52,540 --> 00:07:53,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A corpse?</font>

154
00:07:53,660 --> 00:07:54,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan killed someone</font>

155
00:07:54,940 --> 00:07:55,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and drank their blood
in his own quarters?</font>

156
00:07:56,060 --> 00:07:57,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How utterly monstrous.</font>

157
00:07:57,820 --> 00:07:58,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could Prince Duan do this?</font>

158
00:07:58,420 --> 00:07:58,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan,</font>

159
00:07:59,900 --> 00:08:01,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are you certain you saw a body?</font>

160
00:08:04,420 --> 00:08:05,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It doesn't surprise me.</font>

161
00:08:06,020 --> 00:08:06,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Think about it.</font>

162
00:08:07,540 --> 00:08:09,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan has always suffered
from blood cough syndrome.</font>

163
00:08:10,540 --> 00:08:12,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How much blood can one person have?</font>

164
00:08:13,180 --> 00:08:15,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Naturally, he'd need to drink
others' blood to replenish his own.</font>

165
00:08:16,300 --> 00:08:17,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He recently sealed his residence.</font>

166
00:08:18,020 --> 00:08:19,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Surely, some secret has been exposed.</font>

167
00:08:20,780 --> 00:08:22,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, he wants to destroy the evidence.</font>

168
00:08:23,300 --> 00:08:23,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun.</font>

169
00:08:24,340 --> 00:08:25,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's a good thing you ran fast.</font>

170
00:08:25,740 --> 00:08:27,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Otherwise, we might never
have seen you again.</font>

171
00:08:27,660 --> 00:08:29,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is utter lawlessness
and defiance of all authority.</font>

172
00:08:30,540 --> 00:08:31,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Court of Judicial Review
must investigate this.</font>

173
00:08:31,580 --> 00:08:33,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Jiang, do not be so hasty.</font>

174
00:08:34,340 --> 00:08:35,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tomorrow, I will go with you</font>

175
00:08:35,700 --> 00:08:37,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to report this matter to His Majesty.</font>

176
00:08:38,700 --> 00:08:40,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After all, it involves Prince Duan.</font>

177
00:08:40,980 --> 00:08:42,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We must also heed His Majesty's will.</font>

178
00:08:52,380 --> 00:08:53,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wonder what instructions you have</font>

179
00:08:54,140 --> 00:08:55,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for me in private, Your Highness?</font>

180
00:08:56,500 --> 00:08:58,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Little one,
you have not disappointed me.</font>

181
00:08:59,260 --> 00:09:00,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So quickly,</font>

182
00:09:00,380 --> 00:09:02,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you saw that I was helping you.</font>

183
00:09:03,220 --> 00:09:04,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You secretly sent someone to free me</font>

184
00:09:05,380 --> 00:09:06,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and then spread word</font>

185
00:09:06,380 --> 00:09:08,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to Mr. and Ms. Jiang
that I was in danger.</font>

186
00:09:08,900 --> 00:09:09,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Coincidentally,</font>

187
00:09:10,380 --> 00:09:12,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I witnessed the Prince's blood lust.</font>

188
00:09:13,020 --> 00:09:15,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Only you can orchestrate everything</font>

189
00:09:15,740 --> 00:09:17,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so meticulously.</font>

190
00:09:19,620 --> 00:09:21,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then you must understand</font>

191
00:09:21,380 --> 00:09:23,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">why I have kept you here.</font>

192
00:09:24,140 --> 00:09:25,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Leaving the mansion
to deliver this message</font>

193
00:09:25,780 --> 00:09:28,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is betrayal in Prince Duan's eyes.</font>

194
00:09:29,260 --> 00:09:30,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You should understand</font>

195
00:09:31,140 --> 00:09:32,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that my loyalty is absolute.</font>

196
00:09:35,140 --> 00:09:37,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have seen your sincerity.</font>

197
00:09:37,780 --> 00:09:40,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Yufan will take over this case.</font>

198
00:09:40,660 --> 00:09:42,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You will assist him
in the investigation.</font>

199
00:09:42,380 --> 00:09:44,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you know what to say</font>

200
00:09:45,260 --> 00:09:46,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and what not to say?</font>

201
00:09:48,540 --> 00:09:49,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Understood.</font>

202
00:09:49,940 --> 00:09:50,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You may leave.</font>

203
00:09:52,220 --> 00:09:52,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

204
00:10:20,780 --> 00:10:21,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Brother!</font>

205
00:10:21,940 --> 00:10:22,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Brother!</font>

206
00:10:23,060 --> 00:10:24,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's me, your little sister!</font>

207
00:10:25,300 --> 00:10:26,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you standing there for?</font>

208
00:10:26,460 --> 00:10:27,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go!</font>

209
00:10:27,860 --> 00:10:28,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

210
00:10:42,420 --> 00:10:43,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Eunuch Fuhai,</font>

211
00:10:44,740 --> 00:10:45,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">did that man</font>

212
00:10:46,140 --> 00:10:47,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">commit some grave offense?</font>

213
00:10:48,260 --> 00:10:49,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Jun,</font>

214
00:10:49,620 --> 00:10:50,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">some matters</font>

215
00:10:50,900 --> 00:10:52,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are best left unknown.</font>

216
00:10:52,940 --> 00:10:54,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let us be on our way.</font>

217
00:10:55,100 --> 00:10:55,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

218
00:11:07,380 --> 00:11:08,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Physician Liu,</font>

219
00:11:08,420 --> 00:11:09,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how is the Prince's health?</font>

220
00:11:09,700 --> 00:11:10,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Prince collapsed</font>

221
00:11:11,020 --> 00:11:12,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">because his treatment</font>

222
00:11:12,780 --> 00:11:14,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was interrupted.</font>

223
00:11:17,060 --> 00:11:17,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

224
00:11:25,220 --> 00:11:26,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where is Jun Qinglan?</font>

225
00:11:28,980 --> 00:11:29,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She escaped.</font>

226
00:11:29,660 --> 00:11:30,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Escaped?</font>

227
00:11:30,980 --> 00:11:31,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

228
00:11:32,260 --> 00:11:33,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness, bad news.</font>

229
00:11:33,460 --> 00:11:33,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

230
00:11:33,980 --> 00:11:34,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bad news.</font>

231
00:11:35,220 --> 00:11:36,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's trouble outside.</font>

232
00:11:36,820 --> 00:11:38,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You must come and see.</font>

233
00:11:39,020 --> 00:11:40,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Prince Duan's Mansion]
I beg of you.</font>

234
00:11:40,380 --> 00:11:41,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Open the gates.</font>

235
00:11:42,220 --> 00:11:44,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My daughter is still inside.</font>

236
00:11:44,780 --> 00:11:46,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't let that blood-sucking monster</font>

237
00:11:46,660 --> 00:11:48,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">kill my daughter.</font>

238
00:11:48,620 --> 00:11:49,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My husband is on duty in there.</font>

239
00:11:50,020 --> 00:11:51,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please open the gates.</font>

240
00:11:52,020 --> 00:11:53,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That monster has
an insatiable bloodlust.</font>

241
00:11:53,980 --> 00:11:54,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If we don't kill him,</font>

242
00:11:54,940 --> 00:11:56,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he'll come back to ruin us.</font>

243
00:11:57,500 --> 00:11:58,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Prince's life matters.</font>

244
00:11:58,660 --> 00:11:59,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But our lives</font>

245
00:11:59,500 --> 00:12:00,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">matter too!</font>

246
00:12:01,100 --> 00:12:01,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Yes.
- Kill him!</font>

247
00:12:01,700 --> 00:12:02,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Kill him!</font>

248
00:12:02,260 --> 00:12:03,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Kill him!</font>

249
00:12:04,420 --> 00:12:06,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun Qinglan must have spread the word.</font>

250
00:12:06,460 --> 00:12:06,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

251
00:12:07,260 --> 00:12:08,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she wants you dead.</font>

252
00:12:09,300 --> 00:12:13,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Kill him!</font>

253
00:12:13,340 --> 00:12:13,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

254
00:12:14,900 --> 00:12:16,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Kill him!</font>

255
00:12:17,260 --> 00:12:18,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Release them!</font>

256
00:12:18,020 --> 00:12:18,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Kill him!</font>

257
00:12:20,420 --> 00:12:21,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan's bloodlust</font>

258
00:12:22,020 --> 00:12:22,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is merely a rumor.</font>

259
00:12:23,420 --> 00:12:24,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There is no solid proof.</font>

260
00:12:25,260 --> 00:12:26,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How can we claim it is true?</font>

261
00:12:27,660 --> 00:12:28,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Majesty,</font>

262
00:12:28,300 --> 00:12:30,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the streets are buzzing
with this scandal.</font>

263
00:12:30,900 --> 00:12:32,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It has stirred great public fear.</font>

264
00:12:32,540 --> 00:12:33,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I beg you to assign the case</font>

265
00:12:33,540 --> 00:12:35,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to the Court of Judicial Review</font>

266
00:12:35,660 --> 00:12:37,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to quell the unrest.</font>

267
00:12:38,260 --> 00:12:39,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I need more time to consider this.</font>

268
00:12:45,860 --> 00:12:46,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Majesty,</font>

269
00:12:46,780 --> 00:12:48,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have another matter to report.</font>

270
00:12:49,180 --> 00:12:50,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not long ago, Prince Duan,</font>

271
00:12:50,740 --> 00:12:51,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to shut down a gambling den,</font>

272
00:12:52,100 --> 00:12:53,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">killed a man in the open street.</font>

273
00:12:53,580 --> 00:12:55,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The people are outraged by this.</font>

274
00:12:56,420 --> 00:12:58,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The officials have long been grumbling.</font>

275
00:12:58,580 --> 00:12:59,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And now,</font>

276
00:12:59,380 --> 00:13:00,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with this fresh incident,</font>

277
00:13:01,420 --> 00:13:03,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if we fail to give them an explanation,</font>

278
00:13:03,820 --> 00:13:04,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how can we</font>

279
00:13:04,820 --> 00:13:06,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">ever maintain their trust?</font>

280
00:13:09,460 --> 00:13:10,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This involves a high-ranking official.</font>

281
00:13:11,260 --> 00:13:12,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll decide after the truth
comes to light.</font>

282
00:13:13,780 --> 00:13:16,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since Mr. Jiang is willing
to take the case,</font>

283
00:13:17,020 --> 00:13:17,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">then let him have it.</font>

284
00:13:19,220 --> 00:13:20,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I accept this duty.</font>

285
00:13:21,460 --> 00:13:23,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Kill him!
- Kill him!</font>

286
00:13:23,060 --> 00:13:24,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Kill him!
- Kill him!</font>

287
00:13:25,380 --> 00:13:27,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Kill him!
- Kill him!</font>

288
00:13:27,460 --> 00:13:28,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Court of Judicial Review is here.</font>

289
00:13:30,700 --> 00:13:32,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">By order, we are investigating the case.</font>

290
00:13:32,460 --> 00:13:33,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No one shall interfere.</font>

291
00:13:43,140 --> 00:13:46,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Kill him!
- Kill him!</font>

292
00:14:04,380 --> 00:14:05,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've run away.</font>

293
00:14:06,660 --> 00:14:07,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why come back now?</font>

294
00:14:08,180 --> 00:14:09,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan is in my charge.</font>

295
00:14:10,220 --> 00:14:11,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She assists me with the investigation.</font>

296
00:14:11,700 --> 00:14:12,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan,</font>

297
00:14:12,700 --> 00:14:14,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I suggest you treat her with respect.</font>

298
00:14:15,700 --> 00:14:17,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's treacherous.</font>

299
00:14:17,860 --> 00:14:19,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And you dare to employ her?</font>

300
00:14:19,860 --> 00:14:22,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You used your power
to tear a family apart.</font>

301
00:14:22,940 --> 00:14:23,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Comparatively,</font>

302
00:14:24,500 --> 00:14:25,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we're the same.</font>

303
00:14:27,060 --> 00:14:27,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan,</font>

304
00:14:28,420 --> 00:14:29,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I suggest you confess now.</font>

305
00:14:30,260 --> 00:14:31,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Save me the trouble.</font>

306
00:14:34,460 --> 00:14:35,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fool.</font>

307
00:14:35,700 --> 00:14:36,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You!</font>

308
00:14:36,900 --> 00:14:38,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're asking for trouble.</font>

309
00:14:38,660 --> 00:14:40,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief, we found a body
in the back courtyard.</font>

310
00:14:44,140 --> 00:14:45,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now, even if you had more mouths,</font>

311
00:14:46,340 --> 00:14:47,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you couldn't talk your way out of this.</font>

312
00:14:56,740 --> 00:14:57,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief,</font>

313
00:14:57,500 --> 00:14:58,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we found these two bodies</font>

314
00:14:58,260 --> 00:15:00,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in the firewood shed of the west wing.</font>

315
00:15:00,220 --> 00:15:01,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is the one</font>

316
00:15:01,060 --> 00:15:03,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I saw outside Prince Duan's room.</font>

317
00:15:03,700 --> 00:15:04,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief,</font>

318
00:15:04,740 --> 00:15:05,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we dug up these two</font>

319
00:15:05,220 --> 00:15:06,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">from under the back courtyard wall.</font>

320
00:15:15,580 --> 00:15:16,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan,</font>

321
00:15:17,340 --> 00:15:18,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can you determine the time of death?</font>

322
00:15:19,340 --> 00:15:22,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These two skeletons still have
rotting flesh and maggots.</font>

323
00:15:22,820 --> 00:15:24,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yanjing's weather is hot and humid.</font>

324
00:15:24,980 --> 00:15:25,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In the soil, the bodies' decomposition</font>

325
00:15:25,980 --> 00:15:27,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">would naturally accelerate.</font>

326
00:15:29,180 --> 00:15:30,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I believe</font>

327
00:15:31,380 --> 00:15:32,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they died two months ago.</font>

328
00:15:32,700 --> 00:15:33,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Two months ago?</font>

329
00:15:34,540 --> 00:15:35,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wasn't that when Prince Duan</font>

330
00:15:35,740 --> 00:15:37,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">returned to Yanjing from the border?</font>

331
00:15:53,380 --> 00:15:53,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look here.</font>

332
00:15:56,380 --> 00:15:58,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Each of them is emaciated.</font>

333
00:15:59,060 --> 00:16:00,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It looks more like they bled to death.</font>

334
00:16:01,620 --> 00:16:03,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's a wound on each of their necks.</font>

335
00:16:04,140 --> 00:16:05,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The edges are jagged and uneven,</font>

336
00:16:05,980 --> 00:16:07,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">as if gnawed or bitten.</font>

337
00:16:08,300 --> 00:16:10,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Someone must have drained their blood.</font>

338
00:16:10,780 --> 00:16:12,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two keep targeting the Prince.</font>

339
00:16:13,140 --> 00:16:14,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is hardly a proper investigation.</font>

340
00:16:14,660 --> 00:16:16,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We are merely making
logical deductions.</font>

341
00:16:16,420 --> 00:16:17,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A reasonable deduction?</font>

342
00:16:17,940 --> 00:16:18,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Jiang,</font>

343
00:16:19,220 --> 00:16:20,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you cannot possibly believe</font>

344
00:16:20,300 --> 00:16:21,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there is a blood-sucking monster, right?</font>

345
00:16:21,980 --> 00:16:23,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's such a ridiculous claim.</font>

346
00:16:24,980 --> 00:16:25,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Besides,</font>

347
00:16:26,460 --> 00:16:27,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Prince has noble blood.</font>

348
00:16:28,180 --> 00:16:29,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These servants</font>

349
00:16:29,300 --> 00:16:30,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are nothing.</font>

350
00:16:30,900 --> 00:16:31,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That is hard to say.</font>

351
00:16:32,860 --> 00:16:35,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Perhaps Prince Duan has peculiar tastes.</font>

352
00:16:35,900 --> 00:16:37,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And he has blood cough syndrome.</font>

353
00:16:37,620 --> 00:16:38,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No one can explain it
clearly either, right?</font>

354
00:16:40,540 --> 00:16:41,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who says no one can?</font>

355
00:16:42,940 --> 00:16:44,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She knows better than anyone</font>

356
00:16:45,300 --> 00:16:46,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">about my condition.</font>

357
00:16:46,820 --> 00:16:48,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your illness began five years ago.</font>

358
00:16:48,500 --> 00:16:49,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What does it have to do with Qinglan?</font>

359
00:16:49,860 --> 00:16:51,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Proving whether you drink blood
is simple.</font>

360
00:16:51,500 --> 00:16:52,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll just tie you up in a room.</font>

361
00:16:52,420 --> 00:16:53,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One full day and night
will make it clear.</font>

362
00:16:54,220 --> 00:16:54,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

363
00:16:55,380 --> 00:16:56,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Prince is in poor health.</font>

364
00:16:56,620 --> 00:16:57,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If something goes wrong,</font>

365
00:16:57,700 --> 00:16:58,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who among you will take responsibility?</font>

366
00:16:58,340 --> 00:16:59,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will.</font>

367
00:16:59,540 --> 00:17:00,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guards!</font>

368
00:17:00,540 --> 00:17:00,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here!</font>

369
00:17:00,980 --> 00:17:02,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Escort Prince Duan to the room
and bind him.</font>

370
00:17:03,020 --> 00:17:04,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No one is to approach him.</font>

371
00:17:04,620 --> 00:17:05,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

372
00:17:05,820 --> 00:17:07,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll kill anyone who dares lay a hand</font>

373
00:17:07,100 --> 00:17:07,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">on the Prince.</font>

374
00:17:07,900 --> 00:17:08,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See?</font>

375
00:17:08,460 --> 00:17:09,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A guilty conscience reveals itself.</font>

376
00:17:10,540 --> 00:17:11,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Jun also believes</font>

377
00:17:12,700 --> 00:17:13,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that locking me up</font>

378
00:17:14,380 --> 00:17:16,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is the best way to prove it, huh?</font>

379
00:17:16,340 --> 00:17:16,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

380
00:17:17,860 --> 00:17:18,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine.</font>

381
00:17:19,100 --> 00:17:20,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I have one condition.</font>

382
00:17:21,300 --> 00:17:21,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want you</font>

383
00:17:22,380 --> 00:17:23,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to watch over me.</font>

384
00:17:23,580 --> 00:17:24,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

385
00:17:24,500 --> 00:17:25,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I am unwilling,</font>

386
00:17:26,940 --> 00:17:29,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I doubt any of you can stop me.</font>

387
00:17:29,430 --> 00:17:31,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

388
00:17:32,300 --> 00:17:33,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

389
00:17:33,960 --> 00:17:37,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

390
00:17:37,890 --> 00:17:42,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright as a goddess, stirring my soul♪</font>

391
00:17:42,570 --> 00:17:45,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
into the passing years♪</font>

392
00:17:46,550 --> 00:17:50,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪A sky full of stars covers
the peach blossom spring♪</font>

393
00:17:51,080 --> 00:17:55,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With you, hand in hand
across the vast world♪</font>

394
00:17:55,410 --> 00:18:01,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No words needed,
our hearts mirror each other♪</font>

395
00:18:03,540 --> 00:18:07,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Catching a teardrop on my fingertip♪</font>

396
00:18:08,220 --> 00:18:11,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Then gently caressing your face♪</font>

397
00:18:12,260 --> 00:18:16,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We await mercy
as the rain flutters down♪</font>

398
00:18:16,810 --> 00:18:19,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪This floating life
is like a myriad of dreams♪</font>

399
00:18:20,790 --> 00:18:24,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No matter how far the journey,
our passion endures♪</font>

400
00:18:25,390 --> 00:18:29,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let's turn a blind eye
to all the gossip and rumors♪</font>
